{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20210",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 7.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down. What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.69,
      "end_seconds": 13.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "So, I'm here because of a band-like headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.82,
      "end_seconds": 16.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.4,
      "end_seconds": 20.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "About... well, three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.15,
      "end_seconds": 30.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "So, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.94,
      "end_seconds": 47.11,
      "duration_seconds": 16.17,
      "text": "Um, I get some relief from a head massage. It's moderate, honestly. It's worse with stress. I did have a bit of nausea at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.03,
      "end_seconds": 54.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Have you had a band-like headache before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.15,
      "end_seconds": 68.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "A bit, a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.96,
      "end_seconds": 82.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "And what about head injury, blurred vision or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.18,
      "end_seconds": 89.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "No, uh, no head injury, blurred vision or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.03,
      "end_seconds": 97.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Alright, and what about vomiting or jaw pain on chewing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.43,
      "end_seconds": 105.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "I mean, I haven't had vomiting or jaw pain on chewing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.01,
      "end_seconds": 108.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Right, anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.61,
      "end_seconds": 112.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.25,
      "end_seconds": 117.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.73,
      "end_seconds": 126.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Well, my heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.24,
      "end_seconds": 131.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "So, a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.31,
      "end_seconds": 152.53,
      "duration_seconds": 19.22,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. My husband and I live above the shop. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.51,
      "end_seconds": 162.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.38,
      "end_seconds": 169.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.25,
      "end_seconds": 177.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.21,
      "end_seconds": 182.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Erm, I've had migraines, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.79,
      "end_seconds": 191.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Okay, I can see migraines in your file as well. Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.22,
      "end_seconds": 198.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Propranolol. I take it twice a day for the migraine prevention."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.41,
      "end_seconds": 201.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.28,
      "end_seconds": 208.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "40 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.5,
      "end_seconds": 213.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.47,
      "end_seconds": 219.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Uh, my father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.43,
      "end_seconds": 228.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.49,
      "end_seconds": 244.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.3,
      "end_seconds": 273.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.7, height 180 centimetres, BMI works out to 19.8. And SpO2 98 percent on room air, heart rate 64, BP is 113 over 69, weight 64 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.27,
      "end_seconds": 278.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.51,
      "end_seconds": 282.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.58,
      "end_seconds": 302.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Neck muscles are tight and tender, and the eye and limb checks are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.09,
      "end_seconds": 324.27,
      "duration_seconds": 16.18,
      "text": "Please sit back down. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is tension-type headaches with possible medication overuse. It could also be migraine, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.96,
      "end_seconds": 331.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Uh, you know, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.17,
      "end_seconds": 362.09,
      "duration_seconds": 29.92,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like tension-type headaches with possible medication overuse, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order a headache diary, for frequent headaches. Try to limit painkillers to two days a week and keep a diary of the headaches. We'll catch up after the diary. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.46,
      "end_seconds": 366.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Thank you, um, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}